    "metaDescription": "Every Google algorithm update confirmed in 2026, with exact start and end dates — Discover, core and spam updates — and what each one actually changed.",
    "excerpt": "Six confirmed updates in eight months. Here is the dated record of what Google actually rolled out in 2026 — and what each one asked of site owners.",
